67. How would you design observability for an agentic
platform? Answer:I would instrument the platform using distributed traces, metrics, and structured logs. A trace should connect the user request, supervisor decisions, agent delegations, model calls, retrieval operations, policy checks, and tool invocations. I would use OpenTelemetry-compatible instrumentation and propagate trace context across asynchronous tasks. Important metrics include request rate, task success, model latency, tool failures, token consumption, queue delay, and policy denials.
