The most important distinction is:
Deploying an LLM application is not the same as deploying an enterprise AI platform.
An LLM application might contain an API, prompt, and model endpoint. An enterprise AI platform additionally manages agent lifecycles, model routing, tool permissions, durable execution, tenant isolation, evaluations, and operational controls.
